# Multiplayer runs on Supabase Realtime Broadcast.
# Broadcast needs no tables, no SQL and no row-level security — only these two.
#
# You do not normally need this file: the game server address is checked in at
# src/net/gameServer.ts, so a fresh clone already works. Copy this to
# .env.local only to point a build at a DIFFERENT project — these win over the
# checked-in values.
#
# The anon key is public by design: it ships inside the browser bundle.
# Never put the service_role / secret key here.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-publishable-or-anon-key
